  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Pacific Church Partnerships Program - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to build and strengthen partnerships between Pacific and Australian church leaders and faith-based development leaders, and to enable genuine exchange on shared development priorities. There is a focus on leadership and capacity building in identified areas of mutual priority including: Gender, youth empowerment, climate, disaster preparedness, the advancement of human rights and financial and business management. The program provides opportunities to engage directly with Pacific church leaders on regional priorities; build and cultivate strong enduring relationships amongst young emerging leaders, embed First Nations perspectives into programming and strengthen connections with diaspora.</narrative>
  </description>
